                assignees json OPTIONS (ANNOTATION 'Usernames to assign to this issue. Pass one or more user logins to _replace_ the set of assignees on this issue. Send an empty array (&#x60;[]&#x60;) to clear all assignees from the issue. Only users with push access can set assignees for new issues. Without push access to the repository, assignee changes are silently dropped.')
