                secret clob OPTIONS (ANNOTATION 'If provided, the &#x60;secret&#x60; will be used as the &#x60;key&#x60; to generate the HMAC hex digest value for [delivery signature headers](https://docs.github.com/webhooks/event-payloads/#delivery-headers).'),
